♪ You are my safe ♪

586
00:33:24,110 --> 00:33:25,840
♪ Harbor tonight ♪

587
00:33:25,660 --> 00:33:27,420
Will you go back to EAW?

588
00:33:29,520 --> 00:33:33,150
♪ Harbor tonight ♪

589
00:33:31,700 --> 00:33:32,760
I'm not going back.

590
00:33:33,530 --> 00:33:34,330
What's wrong?

591
00:33:39,450 --> 00:33:41,160
Seeing Mr. Xu

592
00:33:41,900 --> 00:33:43,420
reminded me that I haven't played

593
00:33:43,420 --> 00:33:44,680
VR games in a long time.

594
00:33:52,900 --> 00:33:53,920
Do you want to go?

595
00:34:00,960 --> 00:34:01,720
Yeah.

596
00:34:06,090 --> 00:34:08,760
Then... I'll go with you.

597
00:34:36,050 --> 00:34:38,150
Did... Did I bump into you?

598
00:34:40,090 --> 00:34:40,900
No.

599
00:34:41,800 --> 00:34:43,050
I just couldn't hear clearly,

600
00:34:43,050 --> 00:34:44,510
so I got a little closer.

601
00:34:47,500 --> 00:34:49,360
I just wanted you to hear clearly.

602
00:34:59,300 --> 00:35:01,390
I... I need to use the restroom.

603
00:35:15,860 --> 00:35:16,650
What's wrong?

604
00:35:16,650 --> 00:35:17,110
Seriously,

605
00:35:17,110 --> 00:35:19,230
that singer is so handsome.

606
00:36:07,210 --> 00:36:07,920
Mr. Xu.

607
00:36:08,320 --> 00:36:09,110
Yun Li?

608
00:36:09,860 --> 00:36:10,990
Why did you come out?

609
00:36:11,870 --> 00:36:13,070
To get some fresh air?

610
00:36:13,690 --> 00:36:14,460
Or were you also

611
00:36:14,460 --> 00:36:15,720
deafened by the noise?

612
00:36:17,860 --> 00:36:19,010
I really don't understand.

613
00:36:19,010 --> 00:36:20,760
What's the difference between this

614
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:22,020
and renovation noise?

615
00:36:28,650 --> 00:36:30,260
I don't know what Shize was thinking.

616
00:36:30,260 --> 00:36:31,650
He likes quiet

617
00:36:31,650 --> 00:36:33,300
and never listens to rock music,

618
00:36:33,300 --> 00:36:34,760
yet he invited me to this.

619
00:36:35,300 --> 00:36:36,700
We arrived at 4:30,

620
00:36:36,800 --> 00:36:39,000
and I haven't had a sip of water yet.

621
00:36:40,210 --> 00:36:41,610
You guys came that early?

622
00:36:42,860 --> 00:36:44,260
Shize told me to come over

623
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,960
to wait for someone with him.

624
00:36:47,710 --> 00:36:49,310
Wait for someone? Well...

625
00:36:49,330 --> 00:36:50,530
Did that person come?

626
00:36:56,320 --> 00:36:57,110
Yun Li.

627
00:36:57,820 --> 00:36:58,510
Do you remember

628
00:36:58,510 --> 00:36:59,760
I told you before

629
00:37:00,090 --> 00:37:00,800
that Shize is

630
00:37:00,800 --> 00:37:02,330
a very sentimental person?

631
00:37:03,510 --> 00:37:05,310
Once he sets his mind on someone,

632
00:37:05,940 --> 00:37:07,500
he won't change easily.

633
00:37:14,590 --> 00:37:15,920
Something just came up.

634
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:17,610
I'll treat you
to a late-night snack another day.

635
00:37:17,610 --> 00:37:18,670
I'll get going now.

636
00:37:18,850 --> 00:37:19,780
Bye, Mr. Xu.

637
00:37:26,690 --> 00:37:29,190
How did you get here today?

638
00:37:29,500 --> 00:37:30,510
I took a taxi.

639
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:32,150
Then I'll drive you.

640
00:37:32,650 --> 00:37:33,460
No need.

641
00:37:33,590 --> 00:37:35,010
I can just take a taxi.

642
00:37:36,010 --> 00:37:37,780
Okay, then I'll wait with you.

643
00:37:42,360 --> 00:37:44,590
Efe's always first in the comments.

644
00:37:44,780 --> 00:37:47,010
Is that even humanly possible?

645
00:37:47,070 --> 00:37:47,690
Next time, can you

646
00:37:47,690 --> 00:37:48,800
pretend your internet is lagging

647
00:37:48,800 --> 00:37:49,820
and give us a chance?

648
00:37:49,820 --> 00:37:50,620
What's wrong?

649
00:37:51,300 --> 00:37:53,100
I have a follower on EAW

650
00:37:53,320 --> 00:37:54,760
who's really interesting.

651
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:55,760
Every time I post a video,

652
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:57,620
he's always the first to comment.

653
00:37:57,760 --> 00:37:58,610
Then other followers

654
00:37:58,610 --> 00:37:59,460
complain to him, saying,

655
00:37:59,460 --> 00:38:01,920
"How do you always manage
to comment first?"

656
00:38:04,690 --> 00:38:06,260
Actually, he's quite nice.

657
00:38:06,860 --> 00:38:07,860
He watches every video

658
00:38:07,860 --> 00:38:08,710
I post,

659
00:38:09,090 --> 00:38:10,860
and he watches them attentively

660
00:38:10,860 --> 00:38:12,320
and even gives me

661
00:38:12,320 --> 00:38:14,050
some meaningful suggestions.

662
00:38:15,270 --> 00:38:17,530
Sometimes when things are difficult...

663
00:38:17,650 --> 00:38:18,460
When I was in a foreign country,

664
00:38:18,460 --> 00:38:19,690
reading his DMs

665
00:38:19,690 --> 00:38:22,400
made me... feel better.

666
00:38:33,000 --> 00:38:34,150
It's quite nice

667
00:38:35,650 --> 00:38:37,250
to have a follower like that.

668
00:38:40,500 --> 00:38:41,210
Thank you.

669
00:39:00,090 --> 00:39:01,360
Is that you?

670
00:39:08,950 --> 00:39:10,080
Is that you?

671
00:39:15,650 --> 00:39:18,190
Did you get a taxi?

672
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:21,200
I haven't called one yet.

673
00:39:22,710 --> 00:39:23,710
Then do you want to

674
00:39:25,010 --> 00:39:26,870
find somewhere to sit for a while?

675
00:39:35,940 --> 00:39:36,610
So,

676
00:39:37,050 --> 00:39:39,050
you've been following me all along.

677
00:39:43,710 --> 00:39:44,320
Yeah.

678
00:39:48,320 --> 00:39:49,450
I just wanted to know

679
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,260
if you were doing well.

680
00:39:52,690 --> 00:39:54,950
But I was afraid of disturbing your life.

681
00:39:58,110 --> 00:39:58,590
Does it make you

682
00:39:58,590 --> 00:40:00,250
uncomfortable when I do this?

683
00:40:04,550 --> 00:40:05,420
It's okay.

684
00:40:10,950 --> 00:40:12,820
But I still hope you can be honest.

685
00:40:13,650 --> 00:40:14,260
Okay.

686
00:40:16,960 --> 00:40:17,760
Okay.

687
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,750
So, when I was in the UK,

688
00:40:24,090 --> 00:40:27,050
the fan postcards I received

689
00:40:29,190 --> 00:40:30,520
were sent by you, right?

690
00:40:33,110 --> 00:40:33,710
Yeah.

691
00:40:39,010 --> 00:40:39,820
Actually...

692
00:40:43,010 --> 00:40:44,470
Actually, I went to the UK.

693
00:40:46,380 --> 00:40:47,480
When?

694
00:40:48,140 --> 00:40:49,270
Whenever I had time,

695
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,110
I'd go there.

696
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:56,150
So, one rainy day,

697
00:40:57,550 --> 00:40:59,080
I didn't bring an umbrella.

698
00:40:59,550 --> 00:41:01,000
I went to a bookstore,

699
00:41:02,090 --> 00:41:02,900
and someone kind

700
00:41:02,900 --> 00:41:04,500
left an umbrella for me.

701
00:41:05,510 --> 00:41:06,500
Was that you too?

702
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,070
Yeah.

703
00:41:18,150 --> 00:41:18,920
Well...

704
00:41:19,320 --> 00:41:21,400
is it too late to say thank you now?

705
00:41:23,820 --> 00:41:25,420
You already said it just now.

706
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:28,550
Actually,

707
00:41:28,960 --> 00:41:31,150
I always hoped it was you.

708
00:41:42,510 --> 00:41:43,320
I want

709
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:46,060
to take you somewhere later.

710
00:41:48,360 --> 00:41:49,150
Is that okay?

711
00:41:58,360 --> 00:41:59,290
Is it beautiful?

712
00:42:00,550 --> 00:42:01,590
This is the best place

713
00:42:01,590 --> 00:42:02,790
to see the night view.

714
00:42:03,480 --> 00:42:04,070
Yeah.

715
00:42:10,500 --> 00:42:12,610
So, you come here often?

716
00:42:14,710 --> 00:42:15,320
Yeah.

717
00:42:16,460 --> 00:42:17,570
When I'm alone,

718
00:42:18,500 --> 00:42:19,900
I quite like coming here.

719
00:42:26,690 --> 00:42:27,620
In Nanwu...

720
00:42:29,260 --> 00:42:30,760
while you were away,

721
00:42:31,400 --> 00:42:32,110
I also often went to

722
00:42:32,110 --> 00:42:33,510
the rooftop to space out.

723
00:42:35,500 --> 00:42:36,320
Why?

724
00:42:37,710 --> 00:42:38,910
Because I missed you.

725
00:42:46,580 --> 00:42:48,220
♪ I grew used to ♪

726
00:42:48,240 --> 00:42:51,650
♪ Keeping a polite distance ♪

727
00:42:49,610 --> 00:42:50,420
So,

728
00:42:51,090 --> 00:42:52,150
today,

729
00:42:53,150 --> 00:42:54,900
were you waiting for me on purpose?

730
00:42:53,630 --> 00:42:55,840
♪ Until you came along ♪

731
00:42:56,030 --> 00:42:59,610
♪ And messed up all my logic ♪

732
00:43:00,340 --> 00:43:00,940
Yeah.

733
00:43:01,420 --> 00:43:03,600
♪ I once thought it through carefully ♪

734
00:43:03,640 --> 00:43:07,880
♪ The breath drawn as I lean in
on purpose ♪

735
00:43:08,960 --> 00:43:10,710
♪ When I stand right beside you ♪

736
00:43:09,900 --> 00:43:10,610
Lili.

737
00:43:10,730 --> 00:43:15,310
♪ Even silence starts to mean something ♪

738
00:43:13,760 --> 00:43:17,500
Can we... get back together?

739
00:43:16,910 --> 00:43:19,860
♪ I know those fears ♪

740
00:43:19,890 --> 00:43:23,230
♪ May never truly fade away ♪

741
00:43:21,260 --> 00:43:22,920
Then let me ask you something.

742
00:43:23,400 --> 00:43:24,610
When Yun Ye was sick,

743
00:43:26,010 --> 00:43:26,800
why didn't you

744
00:43:26,800 --> 00:43:28,460
reply to my messages for days?

745
00:43:30,900 --> 00:43:33,510
I didn't tell the truth last time.

746
00:43:35,860 --> 00:43:36,650
That day,

747
00:43:38,080 --> 00:43:40,680
I'd just had surgery
for a perforated stomach.

748
00:43:41,180 --> 00:43:42,760
Before that, I'd been running a fever,

749
00:43:42,760 --> 00:43:44,360
and I woke up in the hospital.

750
00:43:45,510 --> 00:43:46,910
I was afraid you'd worry,

751
00:43:47,320 --> 00:43:48,650
so I didn't let you know.

752
00:43:49,930 --> 00:43:50,810
I planned to go to Xifu

753
00:43:50,810 --> 00:43:52,320
to find you after I was discharged.

754
00:43:52,320 --> 00:43:53,820
So when I broke up with you,

755
00:43:53,820 --> 00:43:55,420
why didn't you say anything?

756
00:44:14,660 --> 00:44:15,930
Did you see

757
00:44:16,010 --> 00:44:18,260
the thing I left for you?

758
00:44:21,650 --> 00:44:23,320
You threw away the brochure?

759
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:25,550
Yes.
